        <li><a href="/guides/forest-management-plan" class="text-[#2d5a2d] underline hover:text-[#1a3c1a]">How to Get a Forest Management Plan for Your NY Woodland</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/selective-cutting" class="text-[#2d5a2d] underline hover:text-[#1a3c1a]">Selective Cutting: How It Works and When It Makes Sense</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/woodland-management-plan-nj" class="text-[#2d5a2d] underline hover:text-[#1a3c1a]">Woodland Management Plans for NJ Farmland Assessment</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Source citations -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-3">Sources</h3>
      <ul class="text-xs text-gray-400 space-y-1">
        <li>New York Real Property Tax Law § 480-a (as amended through 2024) — Justia / NY Senate</li>
        <li>NY State Department of Environmental Conservation — 480-a Forest Tax Law program page</li>
